#ASSERT `may submit the application` `the patient personally` `citizen unable to pay`
#ASSERT NOT `may submit the application` `a member of the immediate family` `citizen unable to pay`
#ASSERT `may submit the application` `a member of the immediate family` `citizen unable to pay, incapacitated`
#ASSERT NOT `may submit the application` `a friend of the patient` `citizen unable to pay, incapacitated`

